# Monorepo conventions

- Package manager: **Bun** (`bun run …`). CI uses `bun install --frozen-lockfile`.
- After code changes: run `bun run test` for touched areas; run `bun run check` before finishing.
- Minimize scope — smallest correct diff; do not refactor unrelated code.
- Shared protocol and constants live in @src/shared.ts — update it first when changing message shapes.
- Do not edit generated artifacts: `public/dist/`, `extension/dist/`, `coverage/`, @src/server/worker-configuration.d.ts (use `bun run cf-typegen`).
- Agent branches: `cursor/<descriptive-name>-6eb8`.
- Canonical examples: @src/server/index.ts, @src/chat/ChatApp.tsx, @src/extension/content.ts.
